      "claim": "Occasionally, non‑traditional or “celebration‑of‑life” funerals may feature upbeat or high‑energy songs, but such cases are rare and not representative of the norm.",
      "evidence": "Media reports of alternative funerals and anecdotal accounts of personalized playlists; statistical surveys showing <5 % of funerals use high‑energy EDM.",
